          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "A Google/Firebase API key embedded in the binary may grant access to Firebase RTDB, Cloud Storage, or GCP services based on IAM permissions. | Attacker calls Firebase REST API to attempt unauthenticated read/write on the database."
          },
